SUMMARY:Moldova Bank Rates — Day-60 kill / maintain / double-down
DESCRIPTION:Per CONTEXT.md §5 "Post-launch — Day 60 kill-or-double-down".\n\nCompare month-2 metrics against:\n  - Double down (scope a 2nd country actor — RO/UA/BG): ≥3 paying buyers OR ≥€10/month run-rate\n  - Maintain (no further investment beyond §6 baseline): ≥1 paying buyer AND ≥30 unique non-owner runs in month 2\n  - Kill or silent-maintenance: below both thresholds\n\nDay-60 is NOT the €300/month target — that needs 6+ months of organic discovery. Day-60 only tests whether any demand signal exists.\n\nWrite the decision in docs/operations.md and act on it the same week.\n\nNOTE: this date is set to 60 days after 2026-05-06 (plan creation date). If the actor was flipped Public on a different day\, move this event to (publish_date + 60 days).
